<p> Coking Coal  46,710 (ULD)   -	   Baha Karahasan    18/10</p>
<p> Pig Iron	  860 (LDD) 20,440	Evpo Ageos	  10/10</p>
<p> Molasses     14,160 (LDD)  8,700	Normar Spirit     14/10</p>
<p> Thermal Coal  9,434 (LDD) 22,166	Chennri Veeram    15/10</p>
